":\"usually mean a dock fault rather than a bike fault\"},{\"text\":\"The support desk asks the rider to read the code on the dock display.\",\"line\":10,\"span\":\"Ask the rider to read the code on the dock display\"},{\"text\":\"Fault code E2 is a jammed locking pin.\",\"line\":10,\"span\":\"E2 is a jammed locking pin\"},{\"text\":\"Fault code E4 is a loss of power to the point.\",\"line\":11,\"span\":\"E4 is a loss of power to the point\"},{\"text\":\"An E2 fault is raised to the field crew.\",\"line\":15,\"span\":\"Raise an E2 to the field crew\"},{\"text\":\"If the field crew have already tried 3 times, an E2 fault is raised to the workshop instead.\",\"line\":15,\"span\":\"If the field crew have already tried 3 times,\"},{\"text\":\"An E4 fault is raised to the electrical contractor the same day.\",\"line\":20,\"span\":\"Raise an E4 to the electrical contractor the same day\"},{\"text\":\"A rider charged for a journey that ended at a faulted dock gets the journey refunded.\",\"line\":24,\"span\":\"A rider charged for a journey that ended at a faulted dock gets the journey\"},{\"text\":\"The refund for a journey that ended at a faulted dock is given at the time of the call.\",\"line\":25,\"span\":\"Refund at the time of the call\"},{\"text\":\"The support desk does not wait for the fault to be confirmed before refunding a journey that ended at a faulted dock.\",\"line\":25,\"span\":\"do not wait for the fault to be\"},{\"text\":\"The support desk takes a station out of service in the app when more than half its docks are faulted.\",\"line\":30,\"span\":\"The support desk takes a station out of service in the app when more than half\"}]}","ttft_ms":7080,"type":"result","duration_ms":12046,"uuid":"f4b6834f-71f5-45c4-9b37-6032ffc79d68","ttft_stream_ms":1617,"time_to_request_ms":98,"first_content_frame_ms":1617,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
